  m_text: "You are a college student, and you're about to be a competitor on a student-run
    reality show competition that will be broadcast to the entire campus. Each round,
    you'll compete in a challenge designed by a faculty member. After each challenge,
    all competitors will vote for one person to eliminate, with the winner receiving
    immunity. The person who gets the most votes will be removed from the competition.
    \n\nWill you rise to victory or go down in flames? Will you make allies, enemies,
    or both? To start, create your character:"
